BT /F2 12.20 Tf 0.550 0.180 0.180 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 741.00 Tm (1. API Domain Mismatch) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.100 0.100 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 723.00 Tm (The mobile app displayed the catalog error on the Home screen under All Products. This happens) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.100 0.100 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 708.50 Tm (when the app cannot get usable product catalog data from the backend. The previous testing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.100 0.100 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 694.00 Tm (binary was associated with the wrong production API domain path, specifically the .com API) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.100 0.100 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 679.50 Tm (target instead of the live .in API target used by Lookmefy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.100 0.100 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 656.00 Tm (The confusing part is that the backend could still be healthy while the mobile app failed. That) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.100 0.100 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 641.50 Tm (is possible because the app and the server are separate release units. A working backend does) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.100 0.100 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 627.00 Tm (not guarantee that an old mobile binary is pointing to it.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.20 Tf 0.550 0.180 0.180 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 595.50 Tm (2. Already Submitted Mobile Files Are Immutable) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.100 0.100 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 577.50 Tm (Once an AAB or APK is built, uploaded, or sent to a testing team, the configuration inside that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.100 0.100 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 563.00 Tm (file is frozen. Later code pushes, backend restarts, DNS changes, or local edits do not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.100 0.100 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 548.50 Tm (automatically change what is inside that already distributed binary.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.100 0.100 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 525.00 Tm (This is why testers can continue seeing the old error even after the backend deployment looks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.100 0.100 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 510.50 Tm (successful. They may still be running the earlier binary.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.20 Tf 0.550 0.180 0.180 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 479.00 Tm (3. Google Play Version Ordering) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.100 0.100 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 461.00 Tm (Google Play does not decide Android updates only from the visible app version. It uses the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.100 0.100 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 446.50 Tm (numeric versionCode. If the previous submitted build used versionCode 13, a replacement build) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.100 0.100 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 432.00 Tm (must use a higher number. VersionCode 14 is the next valid update value.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.100 0.100 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 408.50 Tm (The visible version was increased from 0.1.6 to 0.1.7 so the release also looks different to) Tj ET
