BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.100 0.100 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 330.00 Tm (React Native and Expo Android apps can have more than one place where version and environment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.100 0.100 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 315.50 Tm (information appears. The app configuration, native Android Gradle configuration, local) Tj ET
