BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.100 0.100 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 277.50 Tm (The risk is that one build path may look correct while another still produces an old version or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.100 0.100 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 263.00 Tm (old API target. This matters when trying to create files for Play Store review quickly.) Tj ET
