BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.100 0.100 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 213.50 Tm (AAB and APK are not interchangeable for every audience. Play Store testing tracks expect an AAB) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.100 0.100 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 199.00 Tm (in most modern Android release flows. An APK is useful for direct installation or external) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.100 0.100 0.100 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 184.50 Tm (partner review when that team specifically requests an installable APK.) Tj ET
